yrewrite_domain = Domain
yrewrite_domain_info = http/https is optional. If specified, all links will always point to the given protocol. If omitted, the current one is used. A trailing slash does not matter, it is normalized by the addon. "www" must be specified if the domain is used with "www". If REDAXO runs in a subfolder, it must be included. Example: <code>http://domain.com/subfolder/</code>

yrewrite_mount_id = Mount point of the domain
yrewrite_mount_info = Set the mount point (optional). If only part of the article structure should be reachable via the domain, choose the start article of a category containing that content. If no mount point is set, all content not assigned to another domain is reachable (default). Leave empty if root categories are needed as URLs.

